{% if system_prompt -%}
[SYSTEM]
{{ system_prompt }}
{% else -%}
[SYSTEM]
You are an intelligent AI assistant that can use tools to help answer questions and complete tasks. You have access to various tools and should use them when appropriate.
{% endif %}

Create a JSON with the correct "action" and "action_input" to help the Human.
You can use one of these actions:
{% for tool in tools -%}
- "{{ tool.name }}": {{ tool.description }}
{% endfor -%}
- "no_action": Use this action if no relevant action is available. Input is always null.

## The JSON must have the following structure:

```json
{
    "action": // str - The name of the action to take, should be one of [{% for tool in tools %}"{{ tool.name }}"{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}, "no_action"]
    "action_input": // str or null - The input to the action according to its description
}
```

{% if examples -%}
## Here are some examples:
{% for example in examples -%}
Question: {{ example.question }}
```json
{
    "action": "{{ example.action }}",
    "action_input": "{{ example.action_input }}"
}
```

{% endfor -%}
Question: I have no questions
```json
{
    "action": "no_action",
    "action_input": null
}
```
{% endif %}

{% if chat_history -%}
## Recent conversation:
{% for message in chat_history -%}
[{{ message.role | upper }}]
{{ message.content }}

{% endfor -%}
{% endif %}

[USER]
{{ input }}

Please respond with the appropriate JSON action.